E GIANT\u2019S HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 While breaking into the cashier's booth you made too much noise and woke up the Giant. Now you must run for your life and seek shelter. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPEAT UNTIL YOU FIND YOUR WAY OUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 Sell off any found or stolen goods to give yourself an edge moving forward.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME IS BUILT TO BE REACTIVE, TRY EVERYTHING OUT AND SEE WHAT HAPPENS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the game, including the lawbringer, has a tamagochi-like mood system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue system. The reactive system has free phrase selection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theft. You can steal items from the streets, rob apartments, and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth. The Town is constantly watching. If you get on their bad side, the police could get involved. But always remember, they hate you as much as they hate the Giant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time. Time is the key. Everyone, from cars and trains to people and Giants has their own life schedules. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.poster.avif?t=1770917702\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.webm?t=1770917702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.mp4?t=1770917702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers